#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/13-databases.md:293
msgid "A connection holds resources on the database server (and a lock on an SQLite file). Close it also when the query fails: `try` / `finally` (session 9), or `contextlib.closing` in a `with`:"
msgstr ""

